{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "acd5cfa23699ad8b101f31024fdde1a05f140567630470da63a5bf9bf9567f3c", "ja": "（初公演が終わってからも、育は毎日レッスンを\n頑張っている。今日もまだ練習をしてるみたいだが）", "zh": "（首次公演结束后，育还是每天努力上训练课程，\n今天似乎也还在练习。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "e01a5463efebb2da94f3f538640a093b1b9b173b84e46738f919e1ce7f49eefc", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！\n……はぁ、はぁ……えへへ、やっとできた！", "zh": "1、2、3、4！\n……呼、呼……嘿嘿，终于成功了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2982ebaa18f6cfe13a9c4e84d84327e45b9ba545485afa9b4772808dc6b6702d", "ja": "育、お疲れさま。\n遅くなってきたけど、時間は大丈夫か？", "zh": "育，辛苦了。\n时间已经晚了，没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "bde1b791bd257ee5ae098b3150d5be77feb0f45941e9e044e94903fb8e0bcfda", "ja": "{$P$}さん……時間？\nわっ、もう真っ暗だ！　早く帰らなきゃ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……时间？\n哇，天已经这么黑了！得快点回家才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c7bef254ce045cc4d0133af9e788fc9b1a618df96bb7f795ff44611e936d55ad", "ja": "あ、ちょっと待って、育。\n帰りの支度が終わったら、駅まで一緒に行こう。", "zh": "啊，等一下，育。\n等你收拾完东西，我陪你走到车站吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "59adef9a2e0ea17042ac85695b6db404c9275dac6d92ba0ca0f9d38e190fbef4", "ja": "{$P$}さん、送ってくれるの？\nありがとう！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你要陪我走吗？\n谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "41d981478ee6cd3e9667a376074a55f736d7c15127db4a89a286351c330ab373", "ja": "育、だいぶ頑張ってるみたいだな。\n調子はどうだ？", "zh": "你好像很努力呢，\n状况如何呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "00e7401512d9da04dff477b3109f058918012def6bfa7d1c9084cad713cad7ae", "ja": "ぜっこうちょうだよ！　{$P$}さん、\nわたしね、今、アイドルすーっごく楽しいんだ！", "zh": "状况超级好喔！{$P$}先生，\n我啊，现在当偶像当得非常开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "d51720e41a38838172e99e1c923cb18fe34877cc0c7ee11bbdfa9ffcd1a8c924", "ja": "また公演にも出たいし、他のお仕事もやってみたい！\nだから、たくさんお仕事ちょうだいね♪", "zh": "我想继续在公演上表演，也想尝试其他的工作！\n所以你要帮我安排很多工作喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1009_p", "source_sha256": "20021dddd5c98da644196e61a0fa620f6ac91bfd9cb2ffe796f92fa5af6abd7e", "ja": "そうか。なら、今度オーディションを受けてみるか？\nちょうど、育にどうかなと思ってた仕事があるんだ。", "zh": "这样啊，那下次要不要参加试镜？\n刚好有个工作我觉得可以让你试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "ff2f943478d9ce0560789423f3689e816ef84785a41688c02d2f288ca1e6dbad", "ja": "ほんとう！？\nわたし、オーディション受けてみたい！", "zh": "真的吗！？\n我想参加试镜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1011_p", "source_sha256": "088d2c2a2630a09331110e49b25fb7d318d5c7cfe2380e3d9d71ab713e7daac1", "ja": "よし。じゃあ事務室に台本があるから、\nちょっと取って……。", "zh": "好，那剧本放在事务室，\n我去拿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1012_ikunohaha", "source_sha256": "95740a72f1ae2bf59900d07f08240f544f34ecdfc582b89ad7c70291b7bdb016", "ja": "ごめんください。\nこちらに、中谷育という……あら？", "zh": "打扰了，\n请问这里有名叫中谷育的……哎呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "2cdd36537abf41692430c17f45f126d2e53e1b7858ce4d2d950b90d98253bf30", "ja": "あっ、おかあさんだっ！", "zh": "啊，是妈妈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7617cd6ee9d894e7c12275be341aa07716ee24aa99e0762d56c616834126d01e", "ja": "あ、育の……お世話になってます。\n今日は、育のお迎えですか？", "zh": "啊，是育的……承蒙您照顾了。\n您今天是来接育回家的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1015_ikunohaha", "source_sha256": "474df4c781f501e615317ef099c989943fe22706929634cac0aabd0a81e9b3ca", "ja": "ええ。たまたま近くに用事があったものですから……\n育、レッスンが終わったのなら、一緒に帰りましょう。", "zh": "是啊，因为我刚好来附近办事……\n育，如果训练课程结束了，就一起回家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "02876a6f5d0d4b2bc1b8556914fdbd931f92950b2ad4d670f1d4dcee32dae8e3", "ja": "うんっ！　あ、でも台本が……。", "zh": "嗯！啊，可是剧本……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1017_p", "source_sha256": "835eb730659074845a82384909d8e4803af45f8328d8bc6ffb24d08daf007d8a", "ja": "それじゃ、俺は台本を取りに行ってくるよ。\n育は、ここでお母さんと待っていてくれ。", "zh": "那我去拿剧本过来，\n育跟妈妈在这边等吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "cc95089a50105c4ece6ed10dc2dc8d9ea72ae4fc008be91802c0d7e005ac88bb", "ja": "ううん、わたしも行く！\nおかあさん、もう少し待っててくれる？", "zh": "没关系，我也要去！\n妈妈，你可以等我一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1019_ikunohaha", "source_sha256": "6fd531cbcce53d745cd591ecf29330e8ecf83607d4cdd47d71754b562be3d8b2", "ja": "ええ、もちろんよ。外で待ってるわね。\n{$P$}Pさん、失礼します。", "zh": "嗯，当然可以呀，我在外面等喔。\n{$P$}P先生，打扰您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "8085ce81c86a8837fca0f2f8345a5921680004eed22fe1e42b23fb4af0921f73", "ja": "おかあさん、またあとでね！\nわたし、すぐに戻ってくるから！", "zh": "妈妈，待会见啰！\n我马上就回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0f4bf22fbe62a3ba04fab798f246b2d3d322284d280b162e02f2d66bbcb06a29", "ja": "育、これがさっき言ってた台本だ。\nオーディションまでにちゃんと読んでおくんだぞ？", "zh": "育，这就是刚才跟你提到的剧本。\n试镜之前一定要读熟喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "4143ceafc6079aab97c8b168a8dbe8598363f01d7d984c83f44bf0539689dc98", "ja": "うん！　家で台本を読むときは、いつもおかあさんが\n手伝ってくれるから、だいじょうぶだよ！", "zh": "嗯！我在家读剧本的时候，\n妈妈都会帮我的忙，所以不会有问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1023_p", "source_sha256": "fb6b3bc60f8be42aa0049d0874b50ecd6e8954df2f9fd9090f6cd90f459cec36", "ja": "そうか。\n育は、本当にお母さんの事が好きなんだな。", "zh": "这样啊，\n你真的很喜欢妈妈呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "97076abaf534dde6aa465f5df4277bc1fe2a82366363eb75b38144d45e1d0a26", "ja": "うん！　おかあさんってすごいんだよ！　キレイだし、\nお料理もお掃除もお裁縫も、なんでもできるんだから！", "zh": "嗯！我妈妈很厉害喔！不只长得漂亮，\n煮菜、打扫、缝纫，她样样都会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1025_p", "source_sha256": "43832bcf109e4a2af4d357bac61633d1b7bf40b8298dd350630dced0531c0e17", "ja": "確かに、綺麗な人だよな。\nそう言われると、スカウトしたくなってきちゃうな。", "zh": "确实很漂亮呢。\n听你这样一说，我都有点想签下她了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "a750a4cfa0bf754805c8dcca178f6d4dcc5df7919503c102c5c678b429657546", "ja": "え～、ダメだよ？　おかあさんはみんなの\nアイドルじゃなくて、わたしのおかあさんだもん！", "zh": "咦～不行啦！\n她不是大家的偶像，是我的妈妈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "6c40590673bc7f500bf53076e7a6788ed2abd56aa0c7e7c4f7eea75d8bc3535d", "ja": "それに、アイドルはわたしががんばるの！\nそれでもっともっと、おかあさんにほめてもらうんだ♪", "zh": "而且偶像这个职业要由我来努力！\n然后我就能获得妈妈更多更多的称赞♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "7a20fc7b7c80f04dbac262a92d2335f9ec9045705845d72b0a9ff7a02484f7e0", "ja": "わたしがアイドルがんばると、おかあさん、\nすっごくほめてくれるんだよ♪", "zh": "我只要努力当偶像，\n妈妈就会大力夸奖我呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "87cdd646c29f30cc318ada0e53fc0b2503c1fe0190eef4a5180a29ca58015f67", "ja": "そうか。あんな素敵なお母さんを独り占めできて、\nその上たくさん褒めてもらえて、育が羨ましいな。", "zh": "这样啊，可以独占那么棒的妈妈，\n又得到许多称赞，育真是让人羡慕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "c24c348956400ebf7ab282731fb01974b96d6f665364d69f82e20dee03a57b60", "ja": "えへへ……♪　わたし、そろそろ行くね！\n{$P$}さん、さようなら！", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪我差不多该走啰！\n{$P$}先生，再见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_004_1031_p", "source_sha256": "93a50b0f7da44073d7e5ee78322170d612acf1dea81bbe601713dff6f0614763", "ja": "（駆け出す足取りは、とても軽い。母親に褒めてもらう\nことも、育にとって、大切な原動力なんだな）", "zh": "（她跑着离开的脚步相当轻快，\n看来母亲的称赞对育来说也是很重要的动力呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
